error[B0601]: `.enumerated` is a Bloom list's, and this is a TS value Bloom could not type
 --> check/foreign_list_method.bloom:5:32
  |
5 |   for (index, trend) in trends.enumerated() { out = [..out, "\(index)"] }
  |                                ^^^^^^^^^^ a JS array has no such method
